  "referenceNumber": "RUS1826",
  "remarks": "\nCURZON SQUARE LIMITED is an involved person within the meaning of the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 because CURZON SQUARE LIMITED is an entity that is acting on behalf of, or at the direction of, an involved person, namely, Alisher Usmanov, who was designated by the UK Government on 3 March 2022.\n",
